        "text": {
          "en": "The Standard metagame kept evolving this week. Izzet Spellementals returned to the top spot by high-score share, but its Top 8 share was only narrowly ahead of Jund Artifact Sacrifice. While the Izzet Spellementals build has largely settled, Jund is still testing new cards: one winning list featured [[card:Azog, Moria's Ruin|Azog, Moria's Ruin]] and [[card:Wolverine, Fierce Fighter|Wolverine, Fierce Fighter]]: deck:2cb213eef80be589dfef; another played three copies of [[card:The Misty Mountains Cold|The Misty Mountains Cold]] and one [[card:Smaug the Magnificent|Smaug the Magnificent]]: deck:90bee2bf2991b773cb05.",
          "zh": "本周标准环境还在继续演变，红蓝元素重新回归高分占比榜首，但八强占比并没有领先勇得太多。而且相比红蓝元素的构筑已经基本固定，勇得本周还在开发新科技单卡：一套席卷版本带了[[card:Azog, Moria's Ruin|墨瑞亚之灾阿佐格]]和[[card:Wolverine, Fierce Fighter|凶猛战士金刚狼]]：deck:2cb213eef80be589dfef；而另一套席卷牌表带了3个[[card:The Misty Mountains Cold|远方高山，迷雾冰冷]]以及一张[[card:Smaug the Magnificent|了不起的斯毛格]]：deck:90bee2bf2991b773cb05。"
